Third-party code
----------------
None. This port bundles no third-party libraries and no code from any other
port. The registration helper classes under
com/jesz/createdieselgenerators/registrate are original work written for this
workspace; their public API names deliberately mirror Registrate's so that
upstream call sites port unchanged, but no Registrate code is included.

Assets
------
All textures, models, sounds and data files are the upstream project's own work
and ship under its MIT licence. Assets belonging to Create Fly are not bundled;
the mod resolves them from Create Fly at runtime.
